awn before your\0afinal confrontation with that terrible\0abeast from hell.  but you stepped forward\0aand brought forth eternal damnation and\0asuffering upon the horde as a true hero\0awould in the face of something so evil.\0a\0abesides, someone was gonna pay for what\0ahappened to daisy, your pet rabbit.\0a\0abut now, you see spread before you more\0apotential pain and gibbitude as a nation\0aof demons run amok among our cities.\0a\0anext stop, hell on earth!\00you want to quit?\0athen, thou hast lost an eighth!\00let's beat it -- this is turning\0ainto a bloodbath!\00You've bashed and battered your way into\0athe heart of the devil-hive.  Time for a\0aSearch-and-Destroy mission, aimed at the\0aGatekeeper, whose foul offspring is\0acascading to Earth.  Yeah, he's bad. But\0ayou know who's worse!\0a\0aGrinning evilly, you check your gear, and\0aget ready to give the bastard a little Hell\0aof your own making!\00if i were your boss, i'd \0a deathmatch ya in a minute!\00MegaSphere!\00Come here!\00Web Audio API is not available!\00Supercharge!\00Doom 1.2 does not have a version code!\00I'm not looking too good!\00W_GetNumForName: %s not found!\00IWAD file '%s' not found!\00Picked up a medikit that you REALLY need!\00level 20: gotcha!\00$`\5c!\00%s:%i: Z_ChangeTag: block without a ZONEID!\00Unknown \00NVIDIA Corporation \00Vgm \00R_ProjectSprite: invalid sprite number %i \00R_ProjectSprite: invalid sprite frame %i : %i \00Indigo: \00Brown: \00Green: \00Red: \00R_Init: Init DOOM refresh daemon - \00                         The Ultimate DOOM Startup v%i.%i                        \00                          DOOM System Startup v%i.%i                          \00                   DOOM 2: Plutonia Experiment v%i.%i                           \00                            DOOM Shareware Startup v%i.%i                           \00                            DOOM Registered Startup v%i.%i                           \00                     DOOM 2: TNT - Evilution v%i.%i                           \00                         DOOM 2: Hell on Earth v%i.%i                           \00MUS\1a\00SAP\0d\00fuck %d \0d\00I_GetPaletteIndex\0a\00Z_CheckHeap: two consecutive free blocks\0a\00Using %s for configuration and saves\0a\00Austin Virtual Gaming: Levels will end after 20 minutes\0a\00-iwad not specified, trying a few iwad names\0a\00Using %s for savegames\0a\00Trying IWAD file:%s\0a\00saving config in %s\0a\00 couldn't open %s\0a\00Loaded music with %s\0a\00 adding %s\0a\00Couldn't open %s: %s\0a\00Couldn't load %s: %s\0a\00Failed to load substitute music file: %s: %s\0a\00%s:%i: Error: %s\0a\00Error initializing SDL_mixer: %s\0a\00Error initialising SDL_mixer: %s\0a\00Error loading midi: %s\0a\00Unknown gfxmode value: %s\0a\00\09default file: %s\0a\00        extra configuration file: %s\0a\00\09%s\0a\00 WARNING: You are playing using one of the Freedoom IWAD\0a files, which might not work in this port. See this page\0a for more information on how to play using Freedoom:\0a   http://www.chocolate-doom.org/wiki/index.php/Freedoom\0a\00not a read stream\0a\00Z_CheckHeap: next block doesn't have proper back link\0a\00Z_CheckHeap: block size does not touch the next block\0a\00SpechitOverrun: Warning: unable to emulatean overrun where numspechit=%i\0a\00Error seeking to %i\0a\00startskill %i  deathmatch: %i  startmap: %i  startepisode: %i\0a\00 = %s.ogg\0a\00speed = %.2f, scale = %.2f\0a\00zone memory: %p, %x allocated for zone\0a\00# SHA1 hash                              = filename\0a\00saveg_write8: Error while writing save game\0a\00saveg_read8: Unexpected end of file while reading save game\0a\00Wad file %s doesn't have IWAD or PWAD id\0a\00I_InitGraphics: DOOM screen size: w x h: %d x %d\0a\00Destination pitch is too small, expected at least %d\0a\00G_CheckSpot: unexpected angle %d\0a\00SDL EVENT QUEUE: Maximum events in-flight: %d\0a\00I_InitGraphics: Auto-scaling factor: %d\0a\00I_InitGraphics: Scaling factor: %d\0a\00I_InitGraphics: framebuffer: x_res: %d, y_res: %d, x_virtual: %d, y_virtual: %d, bpp: %d\0a\00I_InitGraphics: framebuffer: RGBA: %d%d%d%d, red_off: %d, green_off: %d, blue_off: %d, transp_off: %d\0a\00Unsupported YUV conversion mode: %d\0a\00M_Episode: 4th episode requires UltimateDOOM\0a\00===========================================================================\0aATTENTION:  This version of DOOM has been modified.  If you would like to\0aget a copy of the original game, call 1-800-IDGAMES or see the readme file.\0a        You will not receive technical support for modified games.\0a                      press enter to continue\0a===========================================================================\0a\00===========================================================================\0a                 Commercial product - do not distribute!\0a         Please report software piracy to the SPA: 1-800-388-PIR8\0a===========================================================================\0a\00===========================================================================\0a                                Shareware!\0a===========================================================================\0a\00Supported game versions:\0a\00Valid mission packs are:\0a\00HU_Init: Setting up heads up display.\0a\00\0a\0aSDL assertion report.\0a\00D_CheckNetGame: Checking network game status.\0a\00M_LoadDefaults: Load system defaults.\0a\00V_Init: allocate screens.\0a\00W_Init: Init WADfiles.\0a\00Loaded %i music substitutions from config files.\0a\00Substitute MIDI config file written to %s.\0a\00Playing demo %s.\0a\00'%s'\0a    * %s (%s:%d)\0a    * triggered %u time%s.\0a    * always ignore: %s.\0a\00EV_VerticalDoor: Tried to close something that wasn't a door.\0a\00Game mode indeterminate.  No IWAD file was found.  Try\0aspecifying one with the '-iwad' command line parameter.\0a\00ST_Init: Init status bar.\0a\00NOTE: Turning resolution is reduced; this is probably because there is a client recording a